eserve segregation","get competent classification and corrected records","Assign ownership and verify team outcomes"],"guide":{"excellent":"Covers the question key points accurately, explains reasoning and demonstrates the expected level of autonomy.","acceptable":"Addresses the core task safely with some omissions; recognizes limitations and appropriate escalation.","weak":"Misses core controls, lacks relevant reasoning, fabricates evidence or proposes unsafe or unauthorized actions."},"notes":"Assess Waste Collection Worker at Team Supervisor level against these key points, not keywords alone. Accept Arabic or English and equivalent methods. Demonstrate prioritization, coaching, control and team coordination; evaluate reasoning, not title or years alone. Do not infer competence from accent, nationality, age, gender or disability. No regulatory certification is conferred. Human review determines recruitment outcomes. Safety responses must stay within training and site procedures."},{"ord":5,"kind":"Technical","competency":"Evidence and root cause","weight":15,"ar":"تكرر الموقف التالي بعد اعتقاد الفريق أنه عولج: وجدت عبوة مجهولة ضمن نفايات عادية. ما الأدلة التي تجمعها لتحديد السبب، وكيف تتحقق من فعالية المعالجة؟ حدد الأولويات وتوزيع المسؤوليات وضوابط التصعيد وكيف تتحقق من النتيجة.","en":"This issue recurs after the team believed it resolved: An unidentified container is found among general waste. What evidence would you gather to identify the cause and verify the fix? Define priorities, delegated responsibilities, escalation controls and outcome verification.","points":["Do not open or compact the container","prevent unqualified handling","request specialist assessment","Trace timeline and source records; test explanation; verify recurrence prevention","Assign ownership and verify team outcomes"],"ideal":"عدم فتح أو ضغط العبوة؛ منع التعامل غير المختص؛ إبلاغ المشرف لتقييم مختص. يراجع التسلسل والسجلات ويختبر السبب دون اتهام أو تخمين، ثم يتحقق من عدم التكرار.","difficulty":"Advanced","seconds":180,"keywords":["Do not open or compact the container","prevent unqualified handling","request specialist assessment","Trace timeline and source records; test explanation; verify recurrence prevention","Assign ownership and verify team outcomes"],"guide":{"excellent":"Covers the question key points accurately, explains reasoning and demonstrates the expected level of autonomy.","acceptable":"Addresses the core task safely with some omissions; recognizes limitations and appropriate escalation.","weak":"Misses core controls, lacks relevant reasoning, fabricates evidence or proposes unsafe or unauthorized actions."},"notes":"Assess Waste Collection Worker at Team Supervisor level against these key points, not keywords alone. Accept Arabic or English and equivalent methods. Demonstrate prioritization, coaching, control and team coordination; evaluate reasoning, not title or years alone. Do not infer competence from accent, nationality, age, gender or disability. No regulatory certification is conferred. Human review determines recruitment outcomes. Safety responses must stay within training and site procedures."},{"ord":6,"kind":"Behavioral","competency":"Prioritization and handover","weight":10,"ar":"أثناء جمع وفرز نفايات وفق التصنيف والإجراءات المعتمدة وصل طلب عاجل وبدأ تسليم الوردية أو المهمة لزميل. كيف تمنع ضياع الطلب أو تكرار تنفيذه؟ حدد الأولويات وتوزيع المسؤوليات وضوابط التصعيد وكيف تتحقق من النتيجة.","en":"While you collect and segregate waste under approved classification and procedures, an urgent request arrives as you hand over to a colleague. How do you prevent a missed or duplicated action? Define priorities, delegated responsibilities, escalation controls and outcome verification.","points":["Assess impact and agree priority","Document current status, next action and named owner","Confirm handover acceptance and follow-up","Assign ownership and verify team outcomes"],"ideal":"يوضح حالة جمع وفرز نفايات وفق التصنيف والإجراءات المعتمدة والإجراء المفتوح وأولويته ومسؤوله، ويتأكد من استلام الزميل ويصعّد تعارض القدرة أو الموعد.","difficulty":"Advanced","seconds":180,"keywords":["Assess impact and agree priority","Document current status, next action and named owner","Confirm handover acceptance and follow-up","Assign ownership and verify team outcomes"],"guide":{"excellent":"Covers the question key points accurately, explains reasoning and demonstrates the expected level of autonomy.","acceptable":"Addresses the core task safely with some omissions; recognizes limitations and appropriate escalation.","weak":"Misses core controls, lacks relevant reasoning, fabricates evidence or proposes unsafe or unauthorized actions."},"notes":"Assess Waste Collection Worker at Team Supervisor level against these key points, not keywords alone. Accept Arabic or English and equivalent methods. Demonstrate prioritization, coaching, control and team coordination; evaluate reasoning, not title or years alone. Do not infer competence from accent, nationality, age, gender or disability. No regulatory certification is conferred. Human review determines recruitment outcomes. Safety responses must stay within training and site procedures."},{"ord":7,"kind":"Technical","competency":"Continuous improvement","weight":15,"ar":"كيف تقيس وتحسن أداء عامل جمع وفرز نفايات باستخدام المؤشر التالي: صحة الفرز مع الحوادث ودقة التسليم؟ ضع تجربة تحسين صغيرة وخطة تدريب ومراجعة للفريق.","en":"How would you measure and improve Waste Collection Worker performance using: Segregation accuracy with incidents and handover accuracy? Design a small improvement trial with team coaching and review.","points":["Define Segregation accuracy with incidents and handover accuracy with source and time period","Check data quality and baseline","Avoid improving speed or volume at the expense of quality or safety","Assign ownership and verify team outcomes"],"ideal":"يعرّف صحة الفرز مع الحوادث ودقة التسليم ومصدره وفترته وخط الأساس، ويراجع الجودة ويجرب تغييرًا محدودًا ويقيس أثره دون التضحية بالسلامة أو حقوق العميل.","difficulty":"Advanced","seconds":180,"keywords":["Define Segregation accuracy with incidents and handover accuracy with source and time period","Check data quality and baseline","Avoid improving speed or volume at the expense of quality or safety","Assign ownership and verify team outcomes"],"guide":{"excellent":"Covers the question key points accurately, explains reasoning and demonstrates the expected level of autonomy.","acceptable":"Addresses the core task safely with some omissions; recognizes limitations and appropriate escalation.","weak":"Misses core controls, lacks relevant reasoning, fabricates evidence or proposes unsafe or unauthorized actions."},"notes":"Assess Waste Collection Worker at Team Supervisor level against these key points, not keywords alone. Accept Arabic or English and equivalent methods. Demonstrate prioritization, coaching, control and team coordination; evaluate reasoning, not title or years alone. Do not infer competence from accent, nationality, age, gender or disability. No regulatory certification is conferred. Human review determines recruitment outcomes. Safety responses must stay within training and site procedures."},{"ord":8,"kind":"Behavioral","competency":"Integrity and data handling","weight":10,"ar":"طُلب منك تسجيل جمع وفرز نفايات وفق التصنيف والإجراءات المعتمدة كمكتملة قبل التحقق، وإرسال سجلها عبر حساب شخصي لتسريع العمل. كيف تتصرف؟ حدد الأولويات وتوزيع المسؤوليات وضوابط التصعيد وكيف تتحقق من النتيجة.","en":"You are asked to mark the task \"collect and segregate waste under approved classification and procedures\" complete before verification and send its records through a personal account to speed things up. How do you respond? Define priorities, delegated responsibilities, escalation controls and outcome verification.","points":["Do not falsely mark work complete","Use authorized channels and minimum necessary data","Escalate pressure and document factual status","Assign ownership and verify team outcomes"],"ideal":"لا يسجل إنجازًا غير متحقق منه، ويستخدم القنوات المعتمدة والحد اللازم من البيانات ويوضح الحالة الحقيقية ويصعّد الضغط وفق السياسة.","difficulty":"Advanced","seconds":180,"keywords":["Do not falsely mark work complete","Use authorized channels and minimum necessary data","Escalate pressure and document factual status","Assign ownership and verify team outcomes"],"guide":{"excellent":"Covers the question key points accurately, explains reasoning and demonstrates the expected level of autonomy.","acceptable":"Addresses the core task safely with some omissions; recognizes limitations and appropriate escalation.","weak":"Misses core controls, lacks relevant reasoning, fabricates evidence or proposes unsafe or unauthorized actions."},"notes":"Assess Waste Collection Worker at Team Supervisor level against these key points, not keywords alone. Accept Arabic or English and equivalent methods. Demonstrate prioritization, coaching, control and team coordination; evaluate reasoning, not title or years alone. Do not infer competence from accent, nationality, age, gender or disability. No regulatory certification is conferred. Human review determines recruitment outcomes. Safety responses must stay within training and site procedures."}]}]$catalog$::jsonb)
  loop
    select id, ai_analysis into v_id, v_existing from public.ai_interview_templates
      where company_id=v_company_id and template_name=t->>'name' and version=1 limit 1;
    if v_id is not null and coalesce(v_existing->>'catalog_release','') <> 'VF-FIELD-20260911' then
      raise exception 'Existing unrelated template with same name: %', t->>'name';
    end if;
    if v_id is null then
      insert into public.ai_interview_templates (
        company_id,template_name,profession,profession_category,language,interview_mode,interaction_mode,camera_mode,
        description,candidate_instructions,opening_message,closing_message,consent_text,duration_minutes,maximum_questions,
        passing_score,allow_ai_follow_up,allow_ai_follow_ups,max_dynamic_follow_ups,allow_candidate_retry,maximum_retries,
        require_microphone_test,require_consent,status,is_active,source_type,requested_question_count,interview_difficulty,
        generation_status,approval_status,approved_by,approved_at,is_locked,is_global,created_by,updated_by,
        ai_analysis,extracted_competencies,extracted_tasks,extracted_skills,extracted_safety_requirements
      ) values (
        v_company_id,t->>'name',t->>'profession',t->>'category','Arabic / English','Voice','Recorded','Optional',
        t->>'description',t->>'instructions','مرحبًا بك في مقابلة VisaFlow: '||(t->>'name'),
        'شكرًا لك. اكتملت المقابلة وتراجع نتائجها بشريًا. Thank you. Your interview will be reviewed by a human.',
        'أوافق على تسجيل وتحليل إجاباتي بالذكاء الاصطناعي لأغراض التقييم الوظيفي، والقرار النهائي للبشر.',
        (t->>'minutes')::integer,8,70,true,true,1,false,0,true,true,'Active',true,'Ready Template',8,t->>'difficulty',
        'Generated','Approved','Platform Owner',now(),true,true,'Platform Owner','Platform Owner',
        jsonb_build_object('catalog_release','VF-FIELD-20260911','level',t->>'level','bilingual',true,'human_review_required',true),
        t->'competencies',t->'tasks',t->'competencies','["Privacy","Accuracy","Authorized actions","Work within training","Human review"]'::jsonb
      ) returning id into v_id;
      for q in select value from jsonb_array_elements(t->'questions') loop
        insert into public.ai_interview_questions (
          company_id,template_id,question_order,question_text,question_text_ar,question_text_en,question_type,competency,
          difficulty_level,weight,maximum_answer_seconds,expected_keywords,key_points,scoring_guide,ideal_answer,recruiter_notes,
          allow_follow_up,maximum_follow_ups,is_required,is_active,source_type,is_ai_generated,approved_by,approved_at,
          is_locked,is_global,created_by,updated_by
        ) values (
          v_company_id,v_id,(q->>'ord')::integer,(q->>'ar')||' / '||(q->>'en'),q->>'ar',q->>'en',q->>'kind',q->>'competency',
          q->>'difficulty',(q->>'weight')::numeric,(q->>'seconds')::integer,q->'keywords',q->'points',q->'guide',q->>'ideal',q->>'notes',
          true,1,true,true,'AI Generated',true,'Platform Owner',now(),true,true,'Platform Owner','Platform Owner'
        );
      end loop;
    end if;
    if (select count(*)=8 and sum(weight)=100 from public.ai_interview_questions where template_id=v_id and is_active) then null;
    else raise exception 'Unexpected question count: %', t->>'name'; end if;
  end loop;
  for c in select value from jsonb_array_elements($campaigns$[{"slug":"technical-maintenance-2026","en":"Field Technical & Maintenance","ar":"الفنيون والصيانة","filter":"field_technical","reuseIds":["b1112991-6b94-4d71-8d4d-eb2f14be8831","c3b56a34-9e2c-4074-8c11-e796d806565d","c5355226-0ec0-4e48-9c6f-169f4a0781f8","72580446-1ba5-4b71-8fbe-d33612e8f0d2","380c0bd3-1474-41a5-9b8a-7ac65ea18fb3","e6e868f0-f7cc-4552-8c14-7035bd7562a7","ef43ba6a-b05c-49bd-85ce-dc7806c7750a","2cc4ba5a-e019-47fe-ae74-239a86a9e5df"]},{"slug":"construction-trades-2026","en":"Construction Trades","ar":"المقاولات والمهن الميدانية","filter":"construction_trades","reuseIds":[]},{"slug":"transport-equipment-2026","en":"Transport & Equipment","ar":"النقل والمعدات","filter":"transport_equipment","reuseIds":[]},{"slug":"manufacturing-production-2026","en":"Manufacturing & Production","ar":"التصنيع والإنتاج","filter":"manufacturing_production","reuseIds":[]},{"slug":"support-services-2026","en":"Support Services","ar":"الخدمات المساندة","filter":"support_services","reuseIds":[]}]$campaigns$::jsonb) loop
    if exists (select 1 from public.talent_public_campaigns where slug=c->>'slug' and coalesce(settings->>'catalog_release','')<>'VF-FIELD-20260911') then
      raise exception 'Existing unrelated campaign: %',c->>'slug';
    end if;
    insert into public.talent_public_campaigns (slug,name_en,name_ar,description_en,description_ar,template_owner_company_id,status,registration_starts_at,settings)
    values (c->>'slug','VisaFlow '||(c->>'en')||' Campaign','حملة VisaFlow — '||(c->>'ar'),
      'Field role interviews at entry, professional and supervisor levels. New templates have 8 questions; existing templates retain their questions. Human review required.',
      'قوالب للمهن الميدانية في مستويات المبتدئ والممارس والمشرف. ٨ أسئلة للقالب الجديد، وتحتفظ القوالب السابقة بأسئلتها، مع مراجعة بشرية للنتائج.',
      v_company_id,'Active',now(),jsonb_build_object('template_filter',c->>'filter','catalog_release','VF-FIELD-20260911','nationality_restriction',false,'existing_template_ids',coalesce(c->'reuseIds','[]'::jsonb)))
    on conflict (slug) do nothing;
  end loop;
end;
$seed$;

create or replace function public.talent_campaign_template_is_eligible(
  p_campaign_id uuid,
  p_template_id uuid
)
returns boolean
language sql
stable
security definer
set search_path = ''
as $$
  select exists (
    select 1
    from public.talent_public_campaigns campaign
    join public.ai_interview_templates template
      on template.id = p_template_id
     and template.company_id = campaign.template_owner_company_id
    where campaign.id = p_campaign_id
      and template.is_active is true
      and template.is_current_version is true
      and template.status = 'Active'
      and template.approval_status = 'Approved'
      and nullif(btrim(template.profession), '') is not null
      and case campaign.settings ->> 'template_filter'
        when 'sales_service' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'sales & customer service' and template.ai_analysis->>'catalog_release' = 'VF-EXPANSION-20260911'
        when 'supply_chain' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'procurement & supply chain' and template.ai_analysis->>'catalog_release' = 'VF-EXPANSION-20260911'
        when 'administration_operations' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'administration & operations' and template.ai_analysis->>'catalog_release' = 'VF-EXPANSION-20260911'
        when 'safety_security' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'safety & security' and template.ai_analysis->>'catalog_release' = 'VF-EXPANSION-20260911'
        when 'marketing_ecommerce' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'marketing & e-commerce' and template.ai_analysis->>'catalog_release' = 'VF-EXPANSION-20260911'
        when 'hospitality_restaurants' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'hospitality & restaurants' and template.ai_analysis->>'catalog_release' = 'VF-EXPANSION-20260911'
        when 'field_technical' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'field technical & maintenance' and template.ai_analysis->>'catalog_release' = 'VF-FIELD-20260911' or coalesce(campaign.settings->'existing_template_ids','[]'::jsonb) ? template.id::text
        when 'construction_trades' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'construction trades' and template.ai_analysis->>'catalog_release' = 'VF-FIELD-20260911' or coalesce(campaign.settings->'existing_template_ids','[]'::jsonb) ? template.id::text
        when 'transport_equipment' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'transport & equipment' and template.ai_analysis->>'catalog_release' = 'VF-FIELD-20260911' or coalesce(campaign.settings->'existing_template_ids','[]'::jsonb) ? template.id::text
        when 'manufacturing_production' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'manufacturing & production' and template.ai_analysis->>'catalog_release' = 'VF-FIELD-20260911' or coalesce(campaign.settings->'existing_template_ids','[]'::jsonb) ? template.id::text
        when 'support_services' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'support services' and template.ai_analysis->>'catalog_release' = 'VF-FIELD-20260911' or coalesce(campaign.settings->'existing_template_ids','[]'::jsonb) ? template.id::text
        when 'junior_accounting' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'junior accounting'
        when 'human_resources' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'human resources'
        when 'finance_accounting' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'finance & accounting'
        when 'information_technology' then lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) = 'information technology'
        when 'engineering' then
          lower(coalesce(template.profession_category, '')) like '%engineer%'
          or lower(template.profession) like '%engineer%'
          or lower(template.profession) like '%engineering%'
        else false
      end
  );
$$;

revoke all on function public.talent_campaign_template_is_eligible(uuid, uuid) from public, anon, authenticated;
grant execute on function public.talent_campaign_template_is_eligible(uuid, uuid) to service_role;
